]

- #strong[Power tags:] #emph[patron\'s gift];, #emph[knows the old names]
- #strong[Weakness tag:] #emph[the debt comes due]
- #strong[PC link:] \"\[PC\] knows what I traded, and hasn\'t told anyone.\"

